><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250807093622+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250807093624+10'00'" name="b3adfe64-b8ac-41f6-8c50-a57a1516e439" page="5" coords="318.050781,298.435211,557.157532,298.435211,318.050781,288.639923,557.157532,288.639923,306.071564,288.002228,557.196655,288.002228,306.071564,278.206940,557.196655,278.206940,306.063599,277.513458,557.213074,277.513458,306.063599,267.718170,557.213074,267.718170,306.039673,267.080475,557.069397,267.080475,306.039673,257.285187,557.069397,257.285187,306.039673,256.591705,557.077637,256.591705,306.039673,246.796417,557.077637,246.796417,306.023743,246.158691,386.467041,246.158691,306.023743,236.363403,386.467041,236.363403" rect="305.717651,236.057297,557.519165,298.741333" subject="Comment on Text" title="alexd"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-10.7pt;text-align:left;color:#211D1E;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>This study provided evidence of good-to-excellent test–retest reli-ability for various performance tests commonly used to assess athletic performance in female handball players. Notably, these tests were also found to maintain consistency across different MC phases, suggesting that performance testing can be scheduled when necessary, as opposed to a specific MC phase.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="5" rect="595.276001,206.435211,779.276001,298.435211"
/></highlight
